              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>1.64 × 6= 116040 × 6 = 918040 = 9.84</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>5.7 × 13.35= 5170 × 1130305= 5170 × × 1 130305 = 716000905=76.095</td><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>"
